    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-100">
            <h2 id="decisions" class="doc-h2">8. Open decisions</h2>
            <table class="doc-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th class="doc-th">#</th>
                        <th class="doc-th">Decision</th>
                        <th class="doc-th">Resolution</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="doc-td">D1</td>
                        <td class="doc-td">Stand up a test PG for development?</td>
                        <td class="doc-td">Asked 2026-08-25. Mapping first (this doc). Test PG is next only after you say go.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr class="doc-tr-alt">
                        <td class="doc-td">D2</td>
                        <td class="doc-td">Inventory on PG?</td>
                        <td class="doc-td">DEFERRED — stay Maria until owner go. GATE 2.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="doc-td">D3</td>
                        <td class="doc-td">Extend PG Gl Result with entry_type / currency before clone?</td>
                        <td class="doc-td">OPEN. Maria has them; PG Gl.pm does not. Prefer Result change + schema-compare over stuffing notes.</td>
                    </tr>
